@startuml
title SplitSmart | Review a group expense
|Group member|
start
:Enter expense, payer and split;
|Application|
if (Authorized member and valid input?) then (yes)
  :Save pending expense, shares and in-app notifications
  to current members except the creator in one transaction;
else (no)
  :Show validation or access error;
  stop
endif
|Reviewer|
:Open pending expense and submit decision;
|Application|
if (Reviewer is group administrator?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Deny review; leave expense pending;
  stop
endif
:Begin write transaction and reread expense;
if (Already decided?) then (yes)
  :Return existing status;
  stop
endif
if (Approve?) then (yes)
  :Record approval and post each eligible share once;
  :Commit approved state and postings together;
else (reject)
  if (Reason supplied?) then (yes)
    :Commit rejected state with reason;
  else (no)
    :Return field error; keep expense pending;
    stop
  endif
endif
|Reviewer|
:View status and current balances;
stop
@enduml
